</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/600a4872-9bec-11f1-858c-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26022584912868.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/600a4872-9bec-11f1-858c-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26022584912868.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">96dd6156-9bea-11f1-8ae3-df2d5e4e4bfa</guid><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:47:15 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/600a4872-9bec-11f1-858c-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26022584912868.jpg">© Phil Sears / AP</source><dc:creator>François-Damien Bourgery</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
